WEBVTT

NOTE
The Deling City parade spectacle — Edea's magic display and the saluting Galbadian troops.
Duration: approximately 37 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.350
Overhead, Edea's float glides under a glowing blue energy ring.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.040
Ribbons of pale magic coil around her.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:27.650
Ranks of Galbadian soldiers salute along the route as fireworks light the sky.
